ith semi-realistic AI editorial character rendering, glossy skin and fabric surfaces, exaggerated low-angle lens distortion, urban lifestyle photography composition, bold sans-serif headline typography, cursive neon-script overlays, and clean magazine-style information hierarchy.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FF2A24\",\n\"#FF5A3D\",\n\"#D91918\",\n\"#F5F5F0\",\n\"#D7D8DA\",\n\"#AEB6C0\",\n\"#1FA9F2\",\n\"#69C9FF\",\n\"#B8E7FF\",\n\"#F7C27A\",\n\"#9A6B4C\",\n\"#2F3338\"\n]\n},\n\"compositional_deconstruction\": {\n\"background\": \"A bright modern city street seen from a very low angle, with tall buildings leaning inward on both sides, overhead cables, blue sky, scattered clouds, sidewalk signage, and small distant pedestrians. The background forms a vertical urban canyon that frames the central crouching figure and supports the poster's upward perspective.\",\n\"elements\": [\n{\n\"type\": \"obj\",\n\"bbox\": [\n140,\n220,\n890,\n820\n],\n\"desc\": \"Red-haired young woman crouching in the center foreground, wearing an all-white futuristic streetwear set with a high-collar jacket, loose white pants, and white boots. Her calm upward-facing expression, wind-swept hair, and large bent knee create the main hero silhouette.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FF2A24\",\n\"#F4F1EA\",\n\"#D7D9DE\",\n\"#B9C0C8\",\n\"#9A5A43\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"text\",\n\"bbox\": [\n65,\n120,\n245,\n875\n],\n\"text\": \"RUBY\",\n\"desc\": \"Huge bold uppercase sans-serif headline placed behind the figure, bright red, tightly tracked, occupying the upper third and partially obscured by the subject's head and hair.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FF2A24\",\n\"#E71918\",\n\"#FFFFFF\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"text\",\n\"bbox\": [\n120,\n245,\n245,\n750\n],\n\"text\": \"Red Hair\",\n\"desc\": \"Large white cursive script crossing over the red headline and the subject's hair, glowing slightly like a handwritten neon signature across the upper-center area.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FFFFFF\",\n\"#FFEDEC\",\n\"#FFB8B8\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"text\",\n\"bbox\": [\n305,\n705,\n430,\n970\n],\n\"text\": \"Red Hair Girl\",\n\"desc\": \"Right-side editorial title block with bold red sans-serif heading and stacked small white uppercase copy beneath it, aligned like magazine feature text over the subject's bent knee and sky area.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FF2A24\",\n\"#FFFFFF\",\n\"#E7EEF5\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"text\",\n\"bbox\": [\n520,\n15,\n850,\n980\n],\n\"text\": \"Pretty\",\n\"desc\": \"Oversized red cursive script sweeping across the lower half of the poster, extremely large, decorative, semi-transparent in places, wrapping around the boots and foreground leg.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FF2A24\",\n\"#F21A18\",\n\"#FF6A58\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"obj\",\n\"bbox\": [\n690,\n120,\n990,\n430\n],\n\"desc\": \"Large white boot and lower leg in the left foreground, exaggerated by low-angle perspective, with glossy highlights, rounded sole, and slight motion softness, anchoring the subject close to the viewer.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FFFFFF\",\n\"#E8E8E4\",\n\"#C9CDD1\",\n\"#9EA5AB\",\n\"#C98D62\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"obj\",\n\"bbox\": [\n610,\n690,\n1000,\n1000\n],\n\"desc\": \"Oversized white foreground leg and boot shape on the lower right, cropped heavily by the poster edge and blurred by glow streaks, adding depth and aggressive street-fashion scale.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FFFFFF\",\n\"#E2E4E7\",\n\"#BCC3CC\",\n\"#8E969E\",\n\"#FF4A35\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"obj\",\n\"bbox\": [\n0,\n0,\n995,\n1000\n],\n\"desc\": \"Composition function region: multiple white horizontal motion streaks and soft flare bands crossing the poster from left to right, partially covering the figure, typography, and buildings to create speed and glossy graphic energy.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FFFFFF\",\n\"#F3FAFF\",\n\"#DDF5FF\",\n\"#B8E7FF\",\n\"#FFB7A8\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"text\",\n\"bbox\": [\n760,\n720,\n820,\n970\n],\n\"text\": \"@khantstudio24\",\n\"desc\": \"Small white social handle set near the lower right over the red script and pale clothing, using a clean bold sans-serif style for social-media branding.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FFFFFF\",\n\"#E8EDF2\",\n\"#CCD3DA\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"obj\",\n\"bbox\": [\n910,\n25,\n985,\n230\n],\n\"desc\": \"Small rating-label-style graphic block in the bottom left corner, white outline and dense microtext on a gray translucent base, functioning as a music-poster authenticity detail.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FFFFFF\",\n\"#D6D6D0\",\n\"#777D82\",\n\"#3D4145\"\n]\n},\n{\n\"type\": \"obj\",\n\"bbox\": [\n905,\n780,\n980,\n970\n],\n\"desc\": \"Small barcode-like graphic panel in the bottom right corner, white diagonal bars inside a thin rectangular frame, acting as a decorative poster-system footer element.\",\n\"color_palette\": [\n\"#FFFFFF\",\n\"#D8DDE2\",\n\"#9EA6AD\",\n\"#50565C\"\n]\n}\n]\n}\n}\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 216, "type": "CR Text", "title": "文本", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [384], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "preview", "label": "preview", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "preview"}, {"name": "bboxes", "label": "bboxes", "type": "BOUNDING_BOX", "localized_name": "bboxes"}, {"name": "width", "links": [387], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [388], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [295.8999938964844, 730], "ideo": {"boxes": [], "editor_touched": false, "palette": [], "import_json_cache": ""}, "p